      "hadithIndex": 2780,
      "bookHadithIndex": 51,
      "text": "Another chain with a similar narration",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd10",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2781,
      "bookHadithIndex": 52,
      "text": "Narrated Humaid bin 'Abdur-Rahman:that he heard Mu'awiyah giving a Khutbah in Al-Madinah, and saying: \"Where are your scholars, O people of Al-Madinah? [Indeed] I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) forbidding from these locks (of hair), and saying: 'The Children of Isra'il were only ruined when their women used them",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2781-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2781-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2781-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2781-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd11",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2782,
      "bookHadithIndex": 53,
      "text": "Narrated 'Abdullah:that the Prophet (ﷺ) cursed the women who practice tattooing and those who seek to be tattooed, the women who remove hair from their faces seeking beautification by changing the creation of Allah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2782-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2782-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2782-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2782-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd12",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2783,
      "bookHadithIndex": 54,
      "text": "Narrated Ibn 'Umar:that the Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"Allah's curse is upon the woman who lengthens hair and the women who seeks to have her hair lengthened, and the woman who tattoos and the woman who seeks to have her herself tattooed",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2783-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2783-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2783-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd13",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2783,
      "bookHadithIndex": 55,
      "text": "(Another chain) with a similar narration",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd14",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2784,
      "bookHadithIndex": 56,
      "text": "Narrated Ibn 'Abbas:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) cursed the women who imitate men and the men who imitate women",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2784-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2784-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2784-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2784-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd15",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2785,
      "bookHadithIndex": 57,
      "text": "Narrated Ibn 'Abbas:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) cursed those men who behave effeminately and those women whose behavior is masculine",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2785-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2785-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2785-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2785-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd16",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2786,
      "bookHadithIndex": 58,
      "text": "Narrated Abu Musa:that the Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"Every eye commits adultery, and when the woman uses perfume and she passes by a gathering, then she is like this and that.'\" Meaning an adulteress",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2786-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2786-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2786-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2786-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd17",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2787,
      "bookHadithIndex": 59,
      "text": "Narrated Abu Hurairah:that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"Fragrance for men is that which its scent is apparent and its color is hidden, and fragrance for women is that which its color is visible and its scent is hidden.\" (Meaning when leaving the home as indicated by the previous chapter. As far as in the presence of the husband, then the woman may wear fragrant perfume)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2787-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2787-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd18",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2787,
      "bookHadithIndex": 60,
      "text": "Another chain of narration similar in meaning",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd19",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2788,
      "bookHadithIndex": 61,
      "text": "Narrated 'Imran bin Husain:\"The Prophet (ﷺ) said [to me]: 'Indeed the best fragrance for men is what's scent is apparent and its color is hidden, and the best fragrance for women is what's color is visible and its scent is hidden.' And he prohibited Mitharatil-Urjawan (Mitharah was some type of saddle cloth. Some of the people of knowledge say it was a certain kind of cloth made of silk, and it preceded earlier under no. 1760. They disagree over Al-Urjawan, and perhaps it means whatever is red, meaning the Red Mitahrah, see Tuhfat Al-Ahwadhi)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2788-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2788-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2788-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd1a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2789,
      "bookHadithIndex": 62,
      "text": "Narrated Thumamah bin 'Abdullah:\"Anas would not refuse perfume, and Anas said: 'Indeed the Prophet (ﷺ) would not refuse perfume",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2789-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2789-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2789-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2789-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd1b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2790,
      "bookHadithIndex": 63,
      "text": "Narrated Ibn 'Umar:that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"There are three that are not refused: Cushions, oils [Duhn (fragrance)], and milk",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2790-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2790-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2790-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd1c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2791,
      "bookHadithIndex": 64,
      "text": "Narrated Abu 'Uthman An-Nahdi:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'When one of you is given some fragrance then do not refuse it, for indeed it comes from Paradise",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2791-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2791-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2791-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd1d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2792,
      "bookHadithIndex": 65,
      "text": "Narrated 'Abdullah:that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"A woman is not to touch a woman such that she can describe her to her husband as if he is looking at her",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2792-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2792-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2792-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2792-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd1e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2793,
      "bookHadithIndex": 66,
      "text": "Narrated 'Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Sa'eed [Al-Khudri] from his father who said:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'A man is not to look at the 'Awrah of a man, and a woman is not to look at the 'Awrah of a woman. A man is not to be alone with a man under one garment, and a woman is not to be alone with a woman under one garment",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2793-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2793-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2793-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd1f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2794,
      "bookHadithIndex": 67,
      "text": "Narrated Bahz bin Hakim:from his father, from his grandfather, who said: \"I said: 'O Prophet of Allah! Regarding our 'Awrah, what of it must we cover and what of it may we leave?' He said: 'Protect your 'Awrah except from your wife or what your right hand possesses.' He said: \"I said: 'O Messenger of Allah! What about when some people are with others?' He said: 'If you are able to not let anyone see it then do not let them see it.'\" He said: \"I said: 'O Prophet of Allah! What about when one of us is alone?' He said: 'Allah is more deserving of being shy from Him than the people",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2794-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2794-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2794-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2794-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd20",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2795,
      "bookHadithIndex": 68,
      "text": "Narrated Zur'ah bin Muslim bin Jardah Al-Aslami:about his grandfather Jarhad, he said: \"The Prophet (ﷺ) passed by Jarhad in the Masjid and his thigh was exposed, so he said: 'Indeed the thigh is 'Awrah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2795-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2795-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2795-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2795-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd21",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2796,
      "bookHadithIndex": 69,
      "text": "Narrated 'Abdullah bin Jardah Al-Aslami:from his father, from the Prophet (ﷺ) who said: \"The thigh is 'Awrah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2796-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2796-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2796-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd22",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2797,
      "bookHadithIndex": 70,
      "text": "Narrated Ibn 'Abbas:that the Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"The thigh is 'Awrah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2797-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2797-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2797-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2797-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd23",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2798,
      "bookHadithIndex": 71,
      "text": "Narrated Abu Az-Zinad:\"Ibn Jarhad informed me from his father, that the Prophet (ﷺ) passed by him while his thigh was exposed, so the Prophet (ﷺ) said: 'Cover your thigh, for indeed it is 'Awrah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2798-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2798-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2798-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2798-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd24",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2799,
      "bookHadithIndex": 72,
      "text": "Narrated Salih bin Abi Hassan:\"I heard Sa'eed bin Musayyab saying: 'Indeed Allah is Tayyib (good) and he loves Tayyib (what is good), and He is Nazif (clean) and He loves cleanliness, He is Karim (kind) and He loves kindness, He is Jawad (generous) and He loves generosity. So clean' - I think he said - 'your courtyards, and do not resemble the Jews.'\" He said: \"I mentioned that to Muhajir bin Mismar, and he said: \"Amir bin Sa'd [bin Abi Waqqas] narrated it to me from his father from the Prophet (ﷺ), similarly, except that he did not say: \"Clean your courtyards",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2799-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2799-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2799-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2799-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd25",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2800,
      "bookHadithIndex": 73,
      "text": "Narrated Abu Muhayyah:from Laith, from Nafi, from Ibn 'Umar that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"Beware of nakedness! For indeed there are with you, those who do not part from you except at the place of defecation, and when a man goes into his wife. So be shy of them and honor them",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2800-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2800-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2800-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd26",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2801,
      "bookHadithIndex": 74,
      "text": "Narrated Jabir:that the Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"Whoever believes in Allah and the Last Day, then he is not to let his wife enter the Hammam, and whoever believes in Allah and the Last Day, then he is not to enter the Hammam without an Izar. And whoever believes in Allah and the Last Day, then he is not to sit at a spread in which Khamr is circulated",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2801-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2801-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2801-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2801-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd27",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2802,
      "bookHadithIndex": 75,
      "text": "Narrated Abu 'Udhrah [and he lived during the time of the Prophet (ﷺ)]:from 'Aishah, that the Prophet (ﷺ) prohibitied the men and women from the Hammamat (plural of Hammam), then he permitted it for the men in Izar",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2802-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2802-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2802-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd28",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2803,
      "bookHadithIndex": 76,
      "text": "Narrated Abu Al-Malih Al-Hudhali:that some women from the inhabitants of Hims, or from the inhabitants of Ash-Sham entered upon 'Aishah, so she said: \"Are you those whose women enter the Hammamat? I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying: 'No woman removes her garments in other than the house of her husband except that she has torn the screen between herself and her Lord",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2803-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2803-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2803-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2803-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd29",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2804,
      "bookHadithIndex": 77,
      "text": "Narrated Ibn 'Abbas:\"I heard Abu Talhah saying: 'I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying: \"The angels do not enter a house in which there is a dog or an object of images",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2804-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2804-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2804-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd2a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2805,
      "bookHadithIndex": 78,
      "text": "Narrated Ishaq bin 'Abdullah bin Abi Talhah:that Rafi' bin Ishaq informed him, saying: \"I and 'Abdullah bin Abi Talhah entered upon Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri to visit him. So Abu Sa'eed said: 'The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) informed us: \"The angels do not enter a house in which there is an image or a picture",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2805-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2805-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2805-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2805-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd2b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2806,
      "bookHadithIndex": 79,
      "text": "Narrated Abu Hurairah:that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"Jibra'il came to me and said: \"Indeed I had come to you last night, and nothing prevented me from entering upon you at the house you were in, except that there were images of men at the door of the house, and there was a curtain screen with imagines on it, and there was a dog in the house. So go and sever the head of the image that is at the door so that it will become like a tree stump, and go and cut the screen and make two throw-cushions to be sat upon, and go and expel the dog.\" So the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) did so, and the dog was a puppy belonging to Al-Husain or Al-Hasan which was under his belongings, so he ordered him to expel it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2806-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2806-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2806-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd2c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2807,
      "bookHadithIndex": 80,
      "text": "Narrated 'Abdullah bin 'Amr:\"A man passed by while wearing two red garments. He gave Salam to the Prophet (ﷺ) but he did not return the Salam",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2807-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2807-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2807-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd2d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2808,
      "bookHadithIndex": 81,
      "text": "Narrated 'Ali bin Abi Talib:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) prohibited the gold ring, Al-Qassi, Al-Mitharah, and Al-Ji'ah (beer)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2808-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih Matn"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2808-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Matn"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2808-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2808-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd2e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2809,
      "bookHadithIndex": 82,
      "text": "Narrated Al-Bara bin 'Azib:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) ordered us with seven things and he forbade us from seven. He ordered us to follow the funeral, visit the ill, reply to the sneezing person, accept the invitation, assist the oppressed, to help the one who made an oath, and to return the Salam. And he forbade us from seven things: From the gold ring, or ringlets of gold, silver vessels, wearing silk, Ad-Dibaj, Al-Istabraq, And Al-Qassi",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2809-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2809-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2809-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2809-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd2f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2810,
      "bookHadithIndex": 83,
      "text": "Narrated Samurah bin Jundab:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'Wear white, for indeed it is very pure and cleaner, and shroud your dead in it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2810-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2810-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2810-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2810-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd30",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2811,
      "bookHadithIndex": 84,
      "text": "Narrated Jabir Bin Samurah:\"I saw the Prophet (ﷺ) on a clear night, so I looked at the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) and at the moon, and he was wearing a red Hullah, and he looked better than the moon to me",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2811-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2811-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd31",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2811,
      "bookHadithIndex": 85,
      "text": "Shu'bah and Ath-Thawri reported it from Abu Ishaq from Al-Bara bin 'Azib who said:\"I saw a red Hullah on the Messenger of Allah.\" (Another chain of narration)",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd32",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2812,
      "bookHadithIndex": 86,
      "text": "Narrated Abu Rimthah:\"I saw the Messenger of Allah wearing two green Burud",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2812-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2812-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2812-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd33",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2813,
      "bookHadithIndex": 87,
      "text": "Narrated 'Aishah:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) went out during the morning wearing a Mirt made of black hair",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2813-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2813-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2813-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd34",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2814,
      "bookHadithIndex": 88,
      "text": "Narrated 'Abdullah bin Hassan:that his grandmothers Safiyyah bint 'Ulaibah and Dhuhaibah bint 'Ulaibah narrated to him, from Qailah bint Makhramah - and they were her wet nurses and Qailah was the grandmother of their father - his mother's mother - she said: \"We came to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)\" and she mentioned the Hadith in its entirety; \"until a man came when the sun had rose up, so he said: \"As-Salamu 'Alaika O Messenger of Allah!' So the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'Wa 'Alaikas-Salamu Wa Rahmatullah' and upon him - meaning the Prophet (ﷺ) - were two tattered cloths, which had been dyed with saffron and had faded, and he had a small date-palm branch with him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2814-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2814-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2814-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd35",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2815,
      "bookHadithIndex": 89,
      "text": "Narrated Anas bin Malik:that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) prohibited saffron for men",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2815-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2815-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2815-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd36",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2815,
      "bookHadithIndex": 89,
      "text": "Narrated Anas bin Malik:that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) prohibited saffron for men",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd37",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2816,
      "bookHadithIndex": 90,
      "text": "Narrated Ya'la bin Murrah:\"The Prophet (ﷺ) saw a man wearing Khuluq and said: 'Go and wash it, then wash it, then do not use it again",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2816-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2816-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2816-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd38",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2817,
      "bookHadithIndex": 91,
      "text": "Narrated The freed slave of Asma:from Ibn 'Umar who said: \"I heard 'Umar mentioning that the Prophet (ﷺ) said: 'Whoever wears silk in the world he shall not wear it in the Hereafter",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2817-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
